# Warrior's Sword: job select makes a 1/1 Hero and attaches the Sword to it: "Equipped creature gets +3/+2 and is a Warrior in
# addition to its other types", so the Hero is a 4/3 Hero Warrior. "Equip {5}" (CR 702.6a): with no untapped Mox it is refused,
# and on turn 3 with five Moxen it moves the Sword to Bot1's Ornithopter (0/2 Thopter -> 3/4 Thopter Warrior); the Hero is a
# plain 1/1 Hero again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Warrior's Sword
Ornithopter
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

